'''Astillero Naval''' ({{Literal translation|Naval Yard}}; {{Langx|mxi|أَسْتِلْيِيرُو نَابَالْ|Astilyéro Nabal}}) is a formerly industrial [[Communes of Balisca|barrio]] in the [[Hisbanya]] borough of the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. It takes its name from the now closed [[Hisbanya Naval Yard]], and is now characterized by its restored 19th- and early 20th-century industrial and warehouse buildings, [[W:Sett (paving)|Baliscan block]] streets, and its location at the confluence of the [[Alagón (river)|Alagón]] and [[Kaawára (river)|Cawára]] rivers. 

